Error [E0749]: `parse_port` can stop, but Panic is denied here
  --> tests/ui/panic_effect_prohibition.jet:2:35
    |
  2 | fn parse_port(raw: String) Int -[!Panic]> { return Int.parse(raw) ?? panic("bad port") }
    |                                   ^^^^^
 Why: `parse_port` can stop; `parse_port` and every reachable callee must not stop when Panic is denied
 Fix: Return a fallible result for expected failure, add facts or a `#Pre`/refinement proof for a programmer-error stop, or drop the `-[!Panic]>` prohibition
